# Secrets — never commit
.env
*.token

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

# Test / tooling
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# `out/` IS TRACKED — deliberately, and this used to say the opposite.
#
# It holds the captured evidence every claim in README/PROGRESS/BACKLOG/EXAMPLES points at:
# the PASS/REVIEW_REQUIRED/FAIL runs, the live GraphQL read-backs, the live-MCP captures, and
# the UI screenshots. Ignoring it would leave a fresh clone full of dangling references to the
# exact artifacts that make the claims checkable — which for this project is the whole point.
# ~15 MB, no secrets (scanned).
#
# Only genuinely-scratch output is excluded, at the repo root .gitignore:
#     blast-radius-autopilot/out/b20_3_scratch/
*.local.html
